A Valk should definitly two weapon.  A second long sword or a
silver sabre, for example.  Or a katana, if you find one---my
first ascension was a Valk two weaponing Grayswandir and a
katana, both at +7.  Combined with speed (so you get two hits
for each monster move), even Orcus counts as a popcorn monster.
(He died before he had time to teleport to the up stairs, or use
even a single charge in his wand.)

